## 📌 Overview

Legal Brief AI helps users understand lengthy legal documents (contracts, agreements, briefs) by breaking them down into simple, digestible summaries. Instead of reading pages of complex legal jargon, users get key points instantly.

---

## ✨ Features

- 📤 Upload legal documents (PDF/TXT format)
- 🤖 AI-powered text summarization
- ⚡ Fast processing and instant results
- 📋 Extracts key clauses, terms, and obligations
- 🎨 Clean and simple user interface
- 🌐 Fully web-based — no installation needed

